        "finding": "Training ResNet-50 from scratch with PtR raises accuracy from 57.33% to 61.71% on CUB200 and from 46.21% to 48.25% on Caltech256-30.",
        "proposed_claim": "PtR can also improve held-out accuracy when training CNNs from scratch.",
        "row_ids": [
          "R26",
